    <item rdf:about="http://alephnull.com/w/recipes/salmon_marinades?rev=1499275186&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2017-07-05T13:19:46-04:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>mcf</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:salmon_marinades - created</title>
        <link>http://alephnull.com/w/recipes/salmon_marinades?rev=1499275186&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Salmon Marinades:

1. Sesame marinade:

	*  4 tablespoons sesami oil
	*  2 tablespoons tamari or soy sauce
	*  2 tablespoons lime juice
	*  1 clove garlic, minced
	*  3 green onions (scallions), chopped

Blend all ingredients and pour over salmon fillets or steaks to marinade.</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="http://alephnull.com/w/recipes/goat_cheese_pasta_salad?rev=1497913187&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2017-06-19T18:59:47-04:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>faith</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:goat_cheese_pasta_salad</title>
        <link>http://alephnull.com/w/recipes/goat_cheese_pasta_salad?rev=1497913187&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>*  8 ounces fusilli pasta
	*  8 tablespoons olive oil
	*  4 tablespoons Sherry wine vinegar
	*  2 tablespoons balsalmic or red wine vinegar
	*  4 plum tomatoes (seeded, chopped, chilled)
	*  2 green onions (sliced very thin, chilled)
	*  5 ounces pitted Kalamata olives (chilled)
	*  8 ounces goat cheese (cut into chunks)
	*  5 basil leaves (cut into thin strips)
	*  1/4 teaspoon salt and/or crushed red pepper (optional)</description>
    </item>
